  "content": {
    "_uid": "fc1fc668-d514-34d4-b6f7-2104d96db008",
    "body": [
      {
        "_uid": "8a7f8272-4ec9-8578-0460-6ab3d85307fd",
        "content": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "The workshop attracted 60 learners from various institutions. Led by experienced nurses, interactive simulation exercises kicked off the workshop, providing hands-on learning opportunities. Following the simulation sessions, a comprehensive debriefing covered essential topics including indications, contraindications, proper placement, and sterility maintenance for IV and catheterization procedures. ",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Collaborations like this will advance medical education and foster a culture of excellence and continuous learning among aspiring healthcare professionals. Through such initiatives, we aim to equip students with essential skills and knowledge, ensuring they are ready to deliver high-quality patient care in the future.",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
